; Sylara (Godot 4.x) — karakter modular:
;   SylaraSkeleton (root: state machine + blending + drive API + signals)
;   ├── Renderer  — _draw() prosedural berlapis (SylaraRenderer.gd)
;   ├── SkillFX   — sequencer FX skill via VFXManager pooled (SylaraSkillFX.gd)
;   └── Feel      — sinkron audio/shake/hit-stop/arc (SylaraCombatFeel.gd)
; Animasi dihitung SylaraAnimator.gd (pose target per state, pakai-ulang);
; satu CanvasItem per karakter supaya optimal dan ringan di Android.
; Flip facing dilakukan PARENT (Hero/Visual), rig digambar menghadap +x.
; Gameplay (damage/cooldown/kit) MILIK HeroSkillKit + CombatSystem — rig ini
; murni visual + feel dan tidak boleh mengubah state gameplay (paritas).

[node name="SylaraSkeleton" type="Node2D" groups=["sylara_skeleton"]]
